      "text": "This research working-set abstract notes that a null predictive association for RF/anti-CCP does not refute anti-TNF efficacy in rheumatoid arthritis. Keep serology-response prediction distinct from treatment efficacy. Graph anchors remain related context only. Source label: RS-0002.",
